Package: wintaskmanager
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-venv, python3-psutil, libxcb-cursor0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-sync1, libxcb-xfixes0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-xkb1, libxcb-util1, libegl1, libgl1, libopengl0, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libdbus-1-3, libxrender1, libxi6, libsm6, libice6, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0
Recommends: python3-pyside6.qtcore (>= 6.6), python3-pyside6.qtgui (>= 6.6), python3-pyside6.qtwidgets (>= 6.6), qt6-svg-plugins, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, smartmontools, dmidecode, lm-sensors, pciutils, sudo, sysbench, fio, glmark2-x11 | glmark2, qt6-wayland
Suggests: docker.io, nvidia-smi
Homepage: https://github.com/Epiklal/linux-task-manager-windows-style
Description: Windows-style task manager for Linux
 Graphical task manager with the look of Windows 10/11 (Qt 6 / PySide6):
 processes, performance (CPU, memory, disks, network, GPU), autostart,
 services, benchmarks, Docker containers and remote monitoring of other
 machines. The interface is available in German and English.
 .
 The package installs the program to /usr/share/wintaskmanager, the
 "wintaskmanager" launcher, a menu entry, the helper for SMART and
 memory data and a (disabled) systemd service "wintaskmanager-server"
 for the remote monitoring server mode.
 .
 PySide6 comes from the system packages (Debian). Where there are none
 (Ubuntu, Linux Mint), the installation creates a virtual environment in
 /opt/wintaskmanager/venv and downloads PySide6 from pypi.org - this
 needs an Internet connection once.
